OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild
OL,6,Fand windy on Monday with patchy rain
OL,7,Fin the west, mainly dry in the east.
OL,8,FEarly rain on Tuesday then dry and
OL,9,Fbright. Mainly dry and bright
OL,10,FWednesday.
